- Display a tree of processes with PIDs: pstree {{[-p|--show-pids]}}
- Display all process trees rooted at processes owned by specified user: pstree {{user}}
- Display command line arguments: pstree {{[-a|--arguments]}}
- Display children of a specified process: pstree {{process_id}}
- Display parents of a specified process: pstree {{[-s|--show-parents]}} {{process_id}}

