# lsmem: List the characteristics of the system's memory, including size and type of memory modules.
- List memory information: lsmem
- List memory information in JSON format: lsmem {{[-J|--json]}}
- List memory information with size in bytes: lsmem {{[-b|--bytes]}}

# free: Display amount of free and used memory in the system.
- Display system memory in KiB: free
- Display memory in bytes/KiB/MiB/GiB (power of 1024): free -{{b|k|m|g}}
- Display memory in the most appropriate human-readable units (KiB/MiB/GiB etc): free {{[-h|--human]}}
- Display memory in the most appropriate human-readable unit that is a power of 1000 (kB/MB/GB etc): free {{-h|--human}} --si
- Refresh the output every 2 seconds: free {{[-s|--seconds]}} 2

