- Remove specific files and directories recursively: rm {{[-r|--recursive]}} {{path/to/file_or_directory1 path/to/file_or_directory2 ...}}
- Remove empty directories (this is considered the safe method): rm {{[-d|--dir]}} {{path/to/directory}}

