- E[x]tract a (compressed) archive [f]ile into the current directory [v]erbosely: tar xvf {{path/to/source.tar.ext}}
- E[x]tract a (compressed) archive [f]ile into the target directory: tar xf {{path/to/source.tar.ext}} {{[-C|--directory]}} {{path/to/directory}}
