- Print the SIZE column in bytes rather than in a human-readable format: lsblk {{[-b|--bytes]}}
- Output info about filesystems: lsblk {{[-f|--fs]}}
- Use ASCII characters for tree formatting: lsblk {{[-i|--ascii]}}
- Output info about block-device topology: lsblk {{[-t|--topology]}}

