- Print different values based on conditions: gawk '{if ($1 == "{{string1}}") print "{{Exact match}}"; else if ($1 ~ "{{string2}}") print "{{Partial match}}"; else print "{{No match}}"}' {{path/to/file}}

# awk: A versatile programming language for working on files. Note: Different implementations of AWK often make this a symlink of their binary. See also: `gawk`.
