- Print 3 lines of [C]ontext around, [B]efore, or [A]fter each match: grep {{--context|--before-context|--after-context}} 3 "{{search_pattern}}" {{path/to/file}}
- Print file name and line number for each match with color output: grep {{[-Hn|--with-filename --line-number]}} --color=always "{{search_pattern}}" {{path/to/file}}
